  "description": "In a world where desire and danger are inextricably linked, a courtesan's sudden death sends shockwaves through both the brothel and the elite circles. Whispers of betrayal stir in the shadows as the Chief Constable is thrust into a complex mystery. As he delves deeper, secrets are revealed and a dangerous game of power, passion, and betrayal unfolds. Can he uncover the truth before it drags him into a deadly game where no one can be trusted?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[AC.QQ](https://ac.qq.com/Comic/ComicInfo/id/657324), [BiliBili](https://manga.bilibili.com/detail/mc39963), [KuaiKan](https://www.kuaikanmanhua.com/web/topic/27271/) \n\n**Official Translations (R19):**     \nEnglish: [INKR (Dropped)](https://comics.inkr.com/title/4782-spring-in-the-jade-pavilion-mature), [Webnovel](https://www.webnovel.com/comic/spring-in-the-jade-pavilion_34851333708187201)   \nKorean: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11078329), [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/4644004603), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/C000064760), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/okluchun)",
